# Action Button

Un boton que permite manejar el estado de carga, error y confirmación de una acción.

## Instalación

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```
::

## Uso

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { ActionButton } from '@/components/ui/action-button'

const handleClick = async () => {
  await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 2000))
}
</script>

<template>
  <ActionButton :action="handleClick">
    Click me
  </ActionButton>
</template>
```

